      "created_at": "2020-06-26T16:43:54Z",
      "updated_at": "2020-06-26T16:43:54Z",
      "body": "The ad-blocker is catching `tags.tiqcdn.com` from one of its lists (Peter Lowe's Server List). Even though Tealium is unblocked under Essential, that is only a pass-through action and patterns can still be caught by the ad-blocker.  This would be another case for a global allow function (see #148). \r\n\r\nIn the meantime, the best solution I can offer would be to either Trust the entire site, or hover over the Tealium tracker and select \"Trust on this site\".",
