      "updated_at": "2020-08-13T14:42:16Z",
      "body": "I double checked the [Peter Lowe list](https://pgl.yoyo.org/adservers/serverlist.php?hostformat=adblockplus) just now and confirmed `tags.tiqcdn.com` is on there.  I do not have control over what goes onto this block list.  We've added it for our users because many of them have requested it, as they like to block as many third-party scripts as possible. ",
